{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女團LE SSERAFIM近日登上美國權威音樂雜誌《Rolling Stone》數碼版封面，成員許允真（Huh Yunjin）在社交平台大晒多張幕後花絮靚相，當中其布料極少的超迷你黑色抹胸造型即時掀起網民熱議。</p><figure><img alt=\"LE SSERAFIM將登上美國權威音樂雜誌《Rolling Stone》數碼版封面。（IG@jenaissante）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203016188637220864396054.jpeg/UUwaYtSJEqZLFNYrIf-HYPi3dhozmbR4eKJ69HiievQ\"/><figcaption>LE SSERAFIM將登上美國權威音樂雜誌《Rolling Stone》數碼版封面。（IG@jenaissante）</figcaption></figure><p>布料少到僅遮重要部位</p><p>向來走歐美辣妹路線的許允真，今次以一頭搶眼金長髮亮相，下身搭配黑色低腰修身喇叭長褲，而上身則僅穿一件尺寸極小的黑色平口抹胸。該件上衣的布料極少，面積幾乎只勉強遮住胸前重要部位，大片白滑美背與零贅肉纖腰一覽無遺。由於這塊黑色布料極度迷你，加上兩側僅靠幼帶固定，側面看去竟與日常佩戴的黑色口罩高度相似，引來大批網民留言笑指「布料少到以為將口罩戴咗喺心口」、「真係挑戰性感極限」。</p><figure><img alt=\"許允真造型惹熱議。（IG@jenaissante）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203016186544132096691087.jpeg/8IrDi1hT8wpr3dHTG2j5BHgJ2RUF1TAv5FdU_-RXVP8\"/><figcaption>許允真造型惹熱議。（IG@jenaissante）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布料極少。（IG@jenaissante）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203016184220356608091382.jpeg/c5UkWTzFGiSKi4K_LHW6pQ8ZDOdg2WU8sv7lwLL-5cA\"/><figcaption>布料極少。（IG@jenaissante）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勉強遮住胸前重要部位。（IG@jenaissante）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203016197500047360324167.jpeg/lu1cfpSnkC3Wq4_tULy4O1ipmDdEb8XwMvHXgTLx14E\"/><figcaption>勉強遮住胸前重要部位。（IG@jenaissante）</figcaption></figure><p>紐約街頭大擺型格甫士派福利</p><p>除了在攝影棚內面對鏡頭擺出冷豔神情及撥弄金髮的花絮照外，許允真亦直接穿着這身極限清涼打扮走到紐約街頭取景。在紐約公共圖書館外的行人路上，她毫不在意途人目光，大方對鏡頭嘟嘴、叉腰大擺型格甫士，展現十足自信。她亦在帖文中用英文興奮留言，直言能與隊友一同登上《Rolling Stone》封面簡直是「夢想成真」，足見其心情大靚。</p><figure><img alt=\"僅靠幼帶固定。（IG@jenaissante）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203016195134328832794150.jpeg/HTdSSpW3YMtKkcWH0u6owvPb2_PZGmXE1lQCyNZUAsg\"/><figcaption>僅靠幼帶固定。（IG@jenaissante）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民留言笑指似口罩。（IG@jenaissante）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203016192852496384893402.jpeg/SV6y166CiaNGcsVisva-FBDIvRyvTGFqDT9puw0_abs\"/><figcaption>網民留言笑指似口罩。（IG@jenaissante）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷身材。（IG@jenaissante）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203016190541303808865937.jpeg/OuRJPGsj_DdQ4rbJui2hlR4fSnKKn2Z_tsOFi7bDhYs\"/><figcaption>大騷身材。（IG@jenaissante）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"心情大靚。（IG@jenaissante）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203016188225916928671823.jpeg/HI0qed0-koZQm36xqRgpFaH3DyFpQTxZGG8lrhhvJa4\"/><figcaption>心情大靚。（IG@jenaissante）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:44:29.468139+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":713,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:30:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T00:57:30.764563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:52.328809+00:00","content_hash":"ec2b4276a87e453773c6e844304f25ac454a8f3648d426615d23bf9e0fddfc01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}